# Night Shift team hub (Efi + Izia)

## Before planning builds or changing scope

1. Read [digest/LIVE.md](digest/LIVE.md), [notifications/NOW.md](notifications/NOW.md), and [ACTION-ITEMS.md](ACTION-ITEMS.md).
2. Check [sources/discord/inbox/](sources/discord/inbox/) for unmerged announcements.
3. Use [RULES.md](RULES.md) and [SCHEDULE.md](SCHEDULE.md) for deadlines and Mubit constraints.
4. For idea/planning/code review requests, use [planning/REVIEW-CHECKLIST.md](planning/REVIEW-CHECKLIST.md) and log changes in [DECISIONS.md](DECISIONS.md).

## Discord intel

- Do not invent Discord announcements. If it is not in `digest/LIVE.md` or `sources/discord/`, say it is unknown and suggest capturing via `scripts/new-inbox-note.sh`.
- After merging Discord content, remind humans to run `scripts/merge-inbox.sh` when LIVE is updated.

## Secrets

- Never commit API keys, Mubit tokens, or `.env` contents.
- Redact other hackers' private emails in pasted Discord content.

## Repo boundaries

- This repo is **event intel and coordination**, not the Flutter app.
- Application code lives in Sprout (separate folder/repo).
- Do not reference or copy Hackathon Engine / HackForge research paths unless the user explicitly asks.

## Luma

- Refresh with `scripts/pull-luma.sh`; update SCHEDULE and digest when the official page or host email changes.
